# Data Source Documentation

This document details the data sources and flow for the HerHub application, including `TrackerViewController`, `ForecastViewController`, and `ProfileViewController`.

## 🔄 Session Management & Data Flow

**Core Component:** `SessionManager` ([SessionManager.swift](file:///Users/apple/Desktop/XcodeXperts-iOS-app%203/working-app/HerHub/SessionManager.swift))

The app uses a centralized session manager to handle user data.
-   **Source of Truth:** `SessionManager.shared.currentUser` holds the active `User` object.
-   **Updates:** The `UserSessionUpdated` notification is broadcast whenever:
    -   User logs in
    -   User logs out
    -   Session is auto-loaded on launch
    -   User profile is updated
-   **Listeners:** View controllers (`TrackerViewController`, `ProfileViewController`) listen for this notification to reload data immediately.

---

## 📊 TrackerViewController (Tracker Storyboard)

**File:** [working-app/HerHub/trackerViewControllers/TrackerViewController.swift](file:///Users/apple/Desktop/XcodeXperts-iOS-app%203/working-app/HerHub/trackerViewControllers/TrackerViewController.swift)

**Trigger:** `viewDidLoad` (initial) & `handleSessionUpdate` (notification)

| Label Outlet | Data Source / Type | Fetch Function / Logic | Line Ref |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `insightTitleLabel` | Static String | Hardcoded: "Today's Insight" | `updateInsightUI`: L325 |
| `insightDescriptionLabel` | `String` | `CycleDataController.shared.getDailyForecasts` -> `forecast.weatherDescription` | `updateInsightUI`: L327 |
| `moodValueLabel` | `String` (Derived) | `CycleDataController.shared.getCheckIns` -> `checkIn.symptomsPresent ? "Mixed" : "Good"` | `updateCheckInUI`: L299 |
| `cycleDayValueLabel` | `String` (Date) | `CycleDataController.shared.getCheckIns` -> `checkIn.date` (Day component) | `updateCheckInUI`: L300 |
| `nextPeriodValueLabel` | `String` (Derived) | `CycleDataController.shared.getCheckIns` -> `checkIn.periodStartedToday ? "Started" : "No"` | `updateCheckInUI`: L301 |
| `energyValueLabel` | `String` (Derived) | `CycleDataController.shared.getCheckIns` -> `checkIn.sleepHours >= 7 ? "High" : "Low"` | `updateCheckInUI`: L302 |
| `dayLabels` (Collection) | `String` (Date) | `CycleDataController.shared.getDailyForecasts` -> `forecast.date` (Day Name e.g., "Mon") | `updateForecastUI`: L366 |
| `dateLabels` (Collection) | `String` (Date) | `CycleDataController.shared.getDailyForecasts` -> `forecast.date` (Day Number e.g., "27") | `updateForecastUI`: L371 |
| `moodLabels` (Collection) | `String` (Enum) | `CycleDataController.shared.getDailyForecasts` -> `forecast.phaseDescription` (Computed property) | `updateForecastUI`: L376 |
| `fertilityBoxes` (Collection) | `String` (Enum) | `CycleDataController.shared.getDailyForecasts` -> `forecast.fertility.displayName` | `updateForecastUI`: L382 |

